ir about face off 2. so often  these things we read about are just  conjecture without any base or  foundation to it then again cage  wouldn't be the first actor to deny  involvement in a film he's secretly in  it's also possible the movie could go  forward with or without his involvement  we thought this day would never come but  it looks like ridley scott is heading  back to ancient rome nearly 20 years  after the original gladiator hit  theaters scott is finally making a  sequel to the story of maximus decimus  meridius of course old maximus is busy  walking through wheat fields in heaven  so what's the sequel going to be about  well according to producer walter f  parks the film is going to start about  25 to 30 years after the original ended  and according to the hollywood reporter  part 2 will focus on lucius the son of  maximus's old flame lucilla the initial  screenplay for the film came from peter  craig whose previous credits include the  town and 2022's the batman but was  subsequently worked on by david scarpa  who also wrote scott's yet to be  released film about napoleon scott  revealed in late 2021 that the script is  already complete and gladiator 2 is  queued up to be the director's next  project once he's finished with napoleon  with ridley scott once again at the helm  we're pretty sure we'll be entertained  the team responsible for the kingsman  films at one point had ambitious plans  for a whopping seven more kingsman  installments a tall order by any measure  now director matthew vaughn seems a  little more restrained in his planning  telling the hollywood reporter in  december 2021 that he's got two more  sequels ready to go and if they work  then one step at a time still the  franchise has built in plenty of room  for more storytelling while the first  two kingsmen film starred taryn edgerton  as the newly minted british secret agent  eggsy 2021's the king's man is a prequel  focused on the early days of the  kingsman agency civilized  but merciless  so far we've heard of a potential third  exec-centric film and a spin-off focused  on the american counterparts to the  kingsman introduced in the second film  titled statesman no release is yet  scheduled for either of these films nor  any of the others but it looks like we  can still expect more kingsman  adventures in whatever form they take  probably not many predicted back in 2012  that the channing tatum led  semi-autobiographical stripper film  magic mic would go on to spawn a  successful trilogy but the magic is set  to continue in magic mike's last stance  original director steven soderbergh is  returning to the director's chair and  tatum will reprise his role as mike lane  while the first magic mike centered  around a teen played by alex pettifer  first entering the world of stripping  tatum's mic took center stage in the  2015 sequel magic mike double xl which  saw a retired mike donning his rip away  pants once more to join his friends on a  road trip to a stripping convention in  myrtle beach the plot of magic mike's  last dance is still under wraps but  soderbergh has offered a few teases of  what to expect including seeing mike in  a serious relationship for the first  time he told collider in early 2022 the  third movie is the sort of apex of  everything that we've been talking about  in that area not just taking the dancing  to another level but really getting into  the relationship aspect that's been an  undercurrent in all of the films salma  hayek is playing the female lead  replacing original actor tanduay newton  who will most likely help mike lane's  last magic dance be the best it can be  magic mike's last dance will be released  exclusively on hbo max  when the megs swam into the public  consciousness some might have scoffed at  this ridiculous sounding jaws rip-off  but this megalodon movie earned some  serious coin at the box office drawing  528 million dollars worldwide against  its 130 million dollar budget after all  this is a movie where jason statham goes  to war with a gigantic shark who doesn't  want to see that  megalodon  he's kidding right  after audiences went into a feeding  frenzy for the film plans were almost  immediately set in motion for a sequel  in october 2020 warner brothers  confirmed that rebecca and high-rise  filmmaker ben wheatley will be helming  the shark-tastic sequel filming for  meg-2 began in january 2022 so hopefully  it won't be long before the sequel swims  onto screens  ahead of the release of spyral from the  book of saw the ninth installment in the  saw horror franchise star chris rock was  already campaigning for a sequel  speaking to radiotimes.com rock said i  hope this movie is like creed in the  sense that creed is technically like  rocky 7. so hopefully there's more  spirals and hopefully i'm in more  spirals but we'll see we'll see if  people like it we'll see if people turn  out people did indeed turn out with  spyral's theatrical take pushing the  horror franchise over the 1 billion mark  at the global box office but even  without knowing how much spiral would  make bloody disgusting reported ahead of  release that lionsgate was in active  development on a tenth saw film although  that hasn't yet been confirmed by the  studio in december 2021 josh stolberg  who co-wrote spiral alongside pete  goldfinger posted a photo on twitter of  both writers alongside producers matt  berg and orrin kulas claiming the group  is already polishing up the script he  also dropped a tease that is sure to  delay itself ends writing this is going  to make jon kramer fans very happy john  cramer of course is the real name of  jigsaw indicating that the franchise's  iconic and deceased villain may make a  shocking comeback in the spiral sequel  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

